    "detailed_description": "This game is a Strategy RPG where you fight by moving each unit.<br />\r\nUse the abilities of the various units to defeat the enemy.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nUse the cursor to select a stage on the world map.<br />\r\nIn each stage, you move your units and fight repeatedly to advance.<br />\r\nEach unit can act in the following order: move, attack.<br />\r\nWhen you attack, you will gain experience, and when you have accumulated a certain number<br />\r\nof experience, your level will increase and your status will improve.<br />\r\nWhen you reach a certain level, you will be able to learn new techniques and magic.<br />\r\nTechniques and magic can be used by consuming SP.<br />\r\nRecovery units can heal instead of attacking, and gain experience through recovery.<br />\r\nSelect &quot;End Turn&quot; to switch to the enemy's turn.<br />\r\nDefeat the enemy boss to clear the stage.<br />\r\nIn stages with companion characters, if they are still alive when the stage is cleared,<br />\r\nthey will be added to your team.<br />\r\nYou can replay stages that have been cleared once.<br />\r\nYou can check the status of each unit on the menu screen and return to the title screen.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou can use the keyboard or PS4 or XBOX360 controller to control the game.<br />\r\nSaving is done automatically.<br />\r\nJapanese and English languages are supported, and can be switched on the title screen.<br />\r\nPress F1 to go full screen.",
    "about_the_game": "This game is a Strategy RPG where you fight by moving each unit.<br />\r\nUse the abilities of the various units to defeat the enemy.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nUse the cursor to select a stage on the world map.<br />\r\nIn each stage, you move your units and fight repeatedly to advance.<br />\r\nEach unit can act in the following order: move, attack.<br />\r\nWhen you attack, you will gain experience, and when you have accumulated a certain number<br />\r\nof experience, your level will increase and your status will improve.<br />\r\nWhen you reach a certain level, you will be able to learn new techniques and magic.<br />\r\nTechniques and magic can be used by consuming SP.<br />\r\nRecovery units can heal instead of attacking, and gain experience through recovery.<br />\r\nSelect &quot;End Turn&quot; to switch to the enemy's turn.<br />\r\nDefeat the enemy boss to clear the stage.<br />\r\nIn stages with companion characters, if they are still alive when the stage is cleared,<br />\r\nthey will be added to your team.<br />\r\nYou can replay stages that have been cleared once.<br />\r\nYou can check the status of each unit on the menu screen and return to the title screen.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou can use the keyboard or PS4 or XBOX360 controller to control the game.<br />\r\nSaving is done automatically.<br />\r\nJapanese and English languages are supported, and can be switched on the title screen.<br />\r\nPress F1 to go full screen.",
